  "keyFeatures": [
    "Automatic text detection using object detection and segmentation models",
    "OCR for manga dialogue, captions, and vertical Japanese text",
    "ML-based inpainting to remove source lettering before rendering",
    "Local and remote LLM translation backends (llama.cpp, OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, DeepSeek)",
    "Advanced text rendering with vertical CJK and RTL layout support",
    "Layered PSD export with editable translated text",
    "Built-in MCP server and local HTTP API for automation and agent integration",
    "Headless mode for scriptable batch translation without a desktop window",
    "GPU acceleration via CUDA, Metal, Vulkan, and ZLUDA",
    "Google Fonts integration for translated text rendering"
  ],
